---
layout: null
---
<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<urlset xmlns="http://www.sitemaps.org/schemas/sitemap/0.9"
        xmlns:news="http://www.google.com/schemas/sitemap-news/0.9">
{%- comment -%}
  Sitemap de notícias para o Google Notícias (formato news-sitemap do Google).
  O Google só aceita artigos publicados nas ÚLTIMAS 48 HORAS neste arquivo
  (as urls mais antigas são simplesmente ignoradas por ele — não é erro).
  Escolhemos automaticamente os posts de site.posts com date >= agora-48h.
  Documentação: https://developers.google.com/search/docs/crawling-indexing/sitemaps/news-sitemap
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign cutoff = site.time | date: '%s' | minus: 172800 -%}
{%- for post in site.posts limit: 1000 -%}
{%- assign post_ts = post.date | date: '%s' | plus: 0 -%}
{%- if post_ts >= cutoff -%}
  <url>
    <loc>{{ post.url | absolute_url }}</loc>
    <news:news>
      <news:publication>
        <news:name>{{ site.title | escape }}</news:name>
        <news:language>pt</news:language>
      </news:publication>
      <news:publication_date>{{ post.date | date_to_xmlschema }}</news:publication_date>
      <news:title>{{ post.title | strip_html | escape }}</news:title>
      {%- if post.tags.size > 0 -%}
      <news:keywords>{{ post.tags | join: ', ' | escape }}</news:keywords>
      {%- endif -%}
    </news:news>
  </url>
{%- endif -%}
{%- endfor -%}
</urlset>
